{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/tiwo2a","slide":4,"text":"Technical feasibility varies by surface and operating system. Android supports user-selected call screening and permissioned notification listeners. Apple provides Call Directory, Live Caller ID and Message Filter extensions. Gmail supports authorized mailbox access and change notifications. Third-party messaging coverage depends on exposed notifications, share actions, integrations and platform policy. Sources: https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telecom/CallScreeningService, https://developer.android.com/reference/android/service/notification/NotificationListenerService, https://developer.apple.com/documentation/IdentityLookup, https://developers.google.com/workspace/gmail/api/guides/push"}
